*bsubstr* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''bsubstr(bytes, start, length)''

Extracts a sub-range from a byte array starting at a specified position.

*Parameters:*
- ''bytes'': Byte array to extract from
- ''start'': Number starting position (1-based)
- ''length'': Number of bytes to extract

*Returns:*
- Bytes: Sub-range of specified length starting at start position

*Errors:*
- Runtime error if bytes is not a byte array
- Runtime error if start is not a number
- Runtime error if length is not a number
- Runtime error if start is less than 1 or length is negative
